<title>SPAIN: Spain's Enher to pay total dividend of 110 pta.</title>
<headline>Spain's Enher to pay total dividend of 110 pta.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish electricity firm Enher said on Tuesday it will pay a gross total dividend of 110 pesetas, up 7.8 percent from the previous year.</p>
<p>A statement said if approved by a shareholders meeting, Enher will pay a final dividend of 57 pesetas on June 17.</p>
<p>Enher had already paid an interim gross dividend of 53 pesetas in January.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
